        {"zh": "吞噬鬼魂，强化自我", "en": "Consume ghost souls, strengthen self"},
        {"zh": "恶鬼来袭，不容错过", "en": "Evil ghosts, don't miss this"},
        {"zh": "这味道是鬼，不会错。", "en": "That smell is a demon, no mistake."},
