        {"zh": "鬼的脖子都很脆。", "en": "A demon's neck is always fragile."},
        {"zh": "等我吃完再打也不迟。", "en": "There is time to fight after I finish eating."},
        {"zh": "你的血鬼术，我猜得到。", "en": "I can guess your Blood Demon Art."},
        {"zh": "我不怕你，只怕自己太饿。", "en": "I do not fear you, only how hungry I am."}
